#: filetypedetails.cpp:50
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"This button displays the icon associated with the selected file type. Click "
"on it to choose a different icon."
msgstr "此按钮显示选中文件类型所关联的图标。单击它以选择一个新的图标。"

#: filetypedetails.cpp:56
#, kde-format
msgid "Filename Patterns"
msgstr "文件名模式"

#: filetypedetails.cpp:68
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"This box contains a list of patterns that can be used to identify files of "
"the selected type. For example, the pattern *.txt is associated with the "
"file type 'text/plain'; all files ending in '.txt' are recognized as plain "
"text files."
msgstr ""
"这个菜单中包含可以确定文件类型的模式列表。例如，模式 *.txt 和文件类型“text/"
"plain”相关联；所有“.txt”结尾的文件会被当作纯文本文件。"

#: filetypedetails.cpp:76 kservicelistwidget.cpp:88
#, kde-format
msgid "Add..."
msgstr "添加..."

#: filetypedetails.cpp:81
#, kde-format
msgid "Add a new pattern for the selected file type."
msgstr "为选中的文件类型添加一个新的模式。"

#: filetypedetails.cpp:83 kservicelistwidget.cpp:102
#, kde-format
msgid "Remove"
msgstr "删除"

#: filetypedetails.cpp:88
#, kde-format
msgid "Remove the selected filename pattern."
msgstr "删除选中的文件名模式。"

#: filetypedetails.cpp:99
#, kde-format
msgid "Description:"
msgstr "描述："

#: filetypedetails.cpp:104
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"You can enter a short description for files of the selected file type (e.g. "
"'HTML Page'). This description will be used by applications like Konqueror "
"to display directory content."
msgstr ""
"在这里输入选中的文件类型的简要描述(例如“HTML 页面”)。Konqueror 等程序会用这些"
"描述显示目录的内容。"

#: filetypedetails.cpp:148
#, kde-format
msgid "Add New Extension"
msgstr "添加新的扩展名"

#: filetypedetails.cpp:148
#, kde-format
msgid "Extension:"
msgstr "扩展名："

